<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3864/69  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7315/20  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9473/83  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4425/35  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.72/73   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8385/00  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1697.0/8.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.17/22  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7815/65  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.3363/13  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5919/47  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6360/70</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$342.00/50</p>
</text>
